       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             JULGREG.
       AUTHOR.                 HARRY PROCTOR.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

      *****************************************************************
      * UTILITY PROGRAM TO CONVERT BETWEEN GREGORIAN DATE AND JULIAN
      * DATE, CALCULATE A DAY DIGIT FOR A GIVEN DATE AND DETERMINE IF
      * A YEAR IS A LEAP YEAR.
      *
      * CALL THE PROGRAM PASSING THE FOLLOWING LINKAGE PARAMETERS:
      *        GREGORIAN-DATE      PIC X(8)
      *        JULIAN-DATE         PIC X(7)
      *        DAY-DIGIT           PIC X
      *        LEAP-YEAR-FLAG      PIC X
      *
      * ONLY ONE PARAMETER NEEDS TO BE PASSED, EITHER THE GREGORIAN
      * OR JULIAN DATE INCLUDING CENTURY.  THE PROGRAM WILL RETURN
      * ALL FOUR PARAMETERS TO THE CALLING PROGRAM.
      *
      *      THE GREGORIAN DATE IS PASSED AND RETURNED IN YYYYMMDD
      * FORMAT, JULIAN DATE IN YYYYDDD FORMAT.  DAY-DIGIT RETURNED IS
      * 1-7 FOR MONDAY THRU SUNDAY RESPECTIVELY.  LEAP-YEAR-FLAG
      * RETURNED AS 'Y' OR 'N' FOR YES OR NO.
      *
      *      THE GREGORIAN DATE TAKES PRIORITY OVER THE JULIAN DATE.
      * IF BOTH DATES ARE PASSED, THE GREGORIAN DATE IS USED TO
      * TEST FOR LEAP YEAR AND CALCULATE A DAY DIGIT AND THE JULIAN
      * DATE IS RETURNED AS PASSED (IE. UN-EDITED).
      *
      *      IF A PASSED DATE PARAMETER IS INVALID IT WILL BE RETURNED
      * AS 'X' AFTER EDITING.  IF NO DATE IS PASSED ON THE CALL, BOTH
      * DATE FIELDS ARE RETURNED FILLED WITH 'X'.
      *
      *****************************************************************

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SW01                PIC 1.
           88  NO-ERRORS                       VALUE B"0".
           88  DATE-ERROR                      VALUE B"1".
       01  YYYY                PIC  9999.
       01  MM                  PIC  99.
       01  DD                  PIC  99.
       01  ACCUM               PIC S999999.
       01  TACCUM              PIC S999999V99.
       01  RSLT4               PIC S9999.
       01  REMD4               PIC S9999.
       01  RSLT100             PIC S9999.
       01  REMD100             PIC S9999.
       01  RSLT400             PIC S9999.
       01  REMD400             PIC S9999.
       01  NUM-G               PIC 9(8).
       01  NUM-J               PIC 9(7).
       01  YEAR-PTR            PIC 9.
           88  NON-LEAP-YEAR                   VALUE 1.
           88  LEAP-YEAR                       VALUE 2.
       01  MONTH-PTR           PIC 99.

       01  DAYS-TBL.
           05  TBL-DATES.
               10    FILLER    PIC X(52)       VALUE
               "000,031,059,090,120,151,181,212,243,273,304,334,365,".
               10    FILLER    PIC X(52)       VALUE
               "000,031,060,091,121,152,182,213,244,274,305,335,366,".

           05  CAL-DAYS              REDEFINES TBL-DATES.
               10  YEAR-TYPE         OCCURS 2 TIMES.
                   15  NUM-DAYS      OCCURS 13 TIMES.
                       20  YTD-DAYS  PIC XXX.
                       20    FILLER  PIC X.

       01  DATE-PASSED.
           05  YEAR            PIC 9999.
           05  MONTH           PIC 99.
           05  DTE             PIC 99.
       01  ALT-G               REDEFINES DATE-PASSED  PIC 9(8).

       01  JULIAN-DATE.
           05  J-YEAR          PIC  9999.
           05  J-DAYS          PIC S999.
       01  ALT-J               REDEFINES JULIAN-DATE  PIC 9(7).

       01  DAY-DIGIT           PIC 9.

      *****************************************************************
       01  SUB                 PIC  9.
       01  T-TABLE.
           05  T-TAB           OCCURS 2 TIMES
                               PIC X.
      *****************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  G-PARM.
           10  YEAR-PARM       PIC XXXX.
           10  MONTH-PARM      PIC XX.
           10  DTE-PARM        PIC XX.

       01  J-PARM.
           10  J-YEAR-PARM     PIC XXXX.
           10  J-DAYS-PARM     PIC XXX.

       01  D-PARM              PIC X.
       01  L-PARM              PIC X.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING
                               G-PARM
                               J-PARM
                               D-PARM
                               L-PARM.
       000-INIT.
           SET NO-ERRORS       TO TRUE.

       100-MAIN.
           PERFORM EDIT-DATES.
           IF NO-ERRORS
               MOVE ALT-G      TO NUM-G
               MOVE ALT-J      TO NUM-J
               IF NUM-G > 0 AND NUM-J < 1
                   PERFORM CONVERT-GREGORIAN-TO-JULIAN
               ELSE IF NUM-G < 1 AND NUM-J > 0
                   PERFORM CONVERT-JULIAN-TO-GREGORIAN
               ELSE IF NUM-G > 0
                   PERFORM CALCULATE-DAY-DIGIT.
      *****************************************************************
      *    MOVE 0 TO SUB.
      *    DISPLAY T-TAB(SUB).
      *****************************************************************
           GOBACK.

       CONVERT-GREGORIAN-TO-JULIAN.
           MOVE YEAR           TO J-YEAR.
           MOVE MONTH          TO MONTH-PTR.
           MOVE YTD-DAYS (YEAR-PTR MONTH-PTR) TO J-DAYS.
           ADD DTE             TO J-DAYS.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE    TO J-PARM.
           PERFORM CALCULATE-DAY-DIGIT.

       CONVERT-JULIAN-TO-GREGORIAN.
           IF J-DAYS = 0
               MOVE 1          TO J-DAYS.

           PERFORM VARYING MONTH-PTR FROM 13 BY -1 UNTIL
                               J-DAYS > YTD-DAYS(YEAR-PTR MONTH-PTR)
                               CONTINUE
               END-PERFORM.

           MOVE YTD-DAYS(YEAR-PTR MONTH-PTR) TO ACCUM.
           COMPUTE DTE = J-DAYS - ACCUM.
           MOVE MONTH-PTR      TO MONTH.
           MOVE J-YEAR         TO YEAR.
           MOVE DATE-PASSED    TO G-PARM.
           MOVE MONTH          TO MM.
           MOVE DTE            TO DD.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE    TO J-PARM.

           PERFORM CALCULATE-DAY-DIGIT.

       CALCULATE-DAY-DIGIT.
           IF MM < 2 OR MM = 2
               ADD 12          TO MM
               SUBTRACT 1      FROM YYYY.

           DIVIDE YYYY BY 4    GIVING RSLT4.
           DIVIDE YYYY BY 100  GIVING RSLT100.
           DIVIDE YYYY BY 400  GIVING RSLT400.

           COMPUTE ACCUM = DD + 2 * MM + (.6 * (MM + 1)).
           COMPUTE ACCUM = ACCUM + YYYY + RSLT4 - RSLT100 + RSLT400
           COMPUTE ACCUM = ACCUM + 1.

           MOVE ACCUM          TO TACCUM.
           COMPUTE ACCUM = ACCUM / 7.
           COMPUTE ACCUM =  (TACCUM / 7 - ACCUM) * 7 + .5.

           IF ACCUM = 0
               MOVE 7          TO DAY-DIGIT
           ELSE
               MOVE ACCUM      TO DAY-DIGIT.

           MOVE DAY-DIGIT      TO D-PARM.

       EDIT-DATES.
           IF (G-PARM = SPACES) AND (J-PARM = SPACES)
               MOVE "XXXXXXXX" TO G-PARM
               MOVE "XXXXXXX"  TO J-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               IF G-PARM = SPACES
                   MOVE ZEROS  TO DATE-PASSED
                   PERFORM EDIT-JULIAN-DATE
               ELSE
                   PERFORM EDIT-GREGORIAN-DATE
                   IF J-PARM = SPACES
                       MOVE ZEROS   TO JULIAN-DATE.

       EDIT-GREGORIAN-DATE.
           IF G-PARM NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE "XXXXXXXX" TO G-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE
           ELSE
               MOVE G-PARM     TO DATE-PASSED.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               IF YEAR NOT NUMERIC OR YEAR < 0
                   MOVE "XXXX"     TO YEAR-PARM
                   SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               MOVE YEAR       TO YYYY
               PERFORM LEAP-YEAR-TEST.

           IF MONTH NOT NUMERIC OR
              MONTH < 1 OR MONTH > 12
               MOVE "XX"       TO MONTH-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE.

           IF DTE NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE "XX"       TO DTE-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE
           ELSE
           IF DTE < 1  OR DTE > 31
               MOVE "XX"       TO DTE-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE
           ELSE
           IF (MONTH = 4 OR 6 OR 9 OR 11)
               AND DTE > 30
               MOVE "XX"       TO DTE-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE
           ELSE
           IF MONTH = 2 AND NON-LEAP-YEAR AND DTE > 28
               MOVE "XX"       TO DTE-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE
           ELSE
           IF MONTH = 2 AND LEAP-YEAR AND DTE > 29
               MOVE "XX"       TO DTE-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               MOVE MONTH      TO MM
               MOVE DTE        TO DD.

       EDIT-JULIAN-DATE.
           IF J-PARM NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE "XXXXXXX"  TO J-PARM
               SET DATE-ERROR  TO TRUE
           ELSE
               MOVE J-PARM     TO JULIAN-DATE.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               IF J-YEAR < 0
                   MOVE "XXXX" TO J-YEAR-PARM
                   SET DATE-ERROR TO TRUE.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               IF J-DAYS < 1
                   PERFORM SUBTRACT-YEAR THRU SY-EXIT
               ELSE
               MOVE J-YEAR     TO YYYY
               PERFORM LEAP-YEAR-TEST
               IF NON-LEAP-YEAR AND J-DAYS > 365
                   PERFORM ADD-YEAR THRU AY-EXIT
               ELSE
               IF LEAP-YEAR AND J-DAYS > 366
                   PERFORM ADD-YEAR THRU AY-EXIT.

           IF NO-ERRORS
               IF  (J-DAYS > 365 AND NON-LEAP-YEAR) OR
                   (J-DAYS > 366 AND LEAP-YEAR)
                       MOVE "XXX" TO J-DAYS-PARM
                       SET DATE-ERROR TO TRUE.

       SUBTRACT-YEAR.
           SUBTRACT 1          FROM J-YEAR.
           MOVE J-YEAR         TO YYYY.
           PERFORM LEAP-YEAR-TEST.
           IF NON-LEAP-YEAR
               ADD 365         TO J-DAYS
           ELSE
               ADD 366         TO J-DAYS.

           IF J-DAYS < 1
               GO TO SUBTRACT-YEAR.

       SY-EXIT.                EXIT.

       ADD-YEAR.
           ADD 1               TO J-YEAR.
           MOVE J-YEAR         TO YYYY.
           PERFORM LEAP-YEAR-TEST.
           IF NON-LEAP-YEAR
               SUBTRACT 365    FROM J-DAYS
           ELSE
               SUBTRACT 366    FROM J-DAYS.

           IF NON-LEAP-YEAR AND J-DAYS > 365
               GO TO ADD-YEAR
           ELSE
           IF LEAP-YEAR AND J-DAYS > 366
               GO TO ADD-YEAR.

       AY-EXIT.                EXIT.

       LEAP-YEAR-TEST.
           DIVIDE YYYY BY 4    GIVING RSLT4   REMAINDER REMD4.
           DIVIDE YYYY BY 100  GIVING RSLT100 REMAINDER REMD100.

           IF REMD4 = 0
               IF REMD100 = 0
                   DIVIDE YYYY BY 400 GIVING RSLT400
                                      REMAINDER REMD400
                   IF REMD400 = 0
                       SET LEAP-YEAR TO TRUE
                       MOVE "Y" TO L-PARM
                   ELSE
                       SET NON-LEAP-YEAR TO TRUE
                       MOVE "N" TO L-PARM
               ELSE
                   SET LEAP-YEAR TO TRUE
                   MOVE "Y"    TO L-PARM
           ELSE
               SET NON-LEAP-YEAR TO TRUE
               MOVE "N"        TO L-PARM.

